You are building Quanta, an AI-assisted estimating and tender workspace for small contractors and subcontractors.

Tech stack:
- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Shadcn UI
- Supabase
- PostgreSQL
- Supabase Auth
- Supabase Storage
- Vercel

Rules:
- Use strict TypeScript.
- Build reusable components.
- Do not expose API keys in frontend code.
- Do not use mock data if real Supabase data is available.
- Do not change unrelated files.
- Always preserve organisation-level data separation.
- AI outputs are draft only until reviewed by the user.
- Keep the UX clean, modern, premium and subcontractor-focused.
- Use British English spelling.